OL,3,GNEWSACycling club 'devastated' at death
OL,4,Aof rider in Port Glasgow crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FTributes have been paid to a cyclist
OL,7,Fwho died in a crash on a busy
OL,8,FInverclyde road while taking part in a
OL,9,Ftraining session with fellow riders.
OL,11,FIain McTavish, 46, was one of three
OL,12,Fcyclists in a collision with a blue
OL,13,FFord C-Max Zetec on the A8 in Port
OL,14,FGlasgow shortly after 19:00 on Tuesday.
OL,15,FHe died at the scene.
OL,17,FTwo other male cyclists, aged 37 and
OL,18,F27, were taken to hospital following
OL,19,Fthe crash on the road's westbound
OL,20,Fcarriageway between the Langbank and
OL,21,FWoodhall roundabouts.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
